    </atom:author>
    <atom:summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;Bicycles look so cool. Riding one turns out to be rather wibbly-wobbly!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukongs-wibble-wobble-ride-v5.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukongs-wibble-wobble-ride-v5.jpg" alt="Wukong’s Wibble-Wobble Ride" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</atom:summary>
